# REST Client requests (VS Code REST Client syntax).
# Click "Send Request" above a request (or Ctrl+Alt+K on it) - the answer opens in the REST Client tab.
# {{host}} comes from the selected environment (.vscode/settings.json).
@page = 1

### List items
# @name items
GET {{host}}/api/items?page={{page}}
Accept: application/json

### Create an item (uses a value from the previous answer)
POST {{host}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Item {{$randomInt 1 100}}",
  "id": "{{$guid}}",
  "after": "{{items.response.body.$.items[0]}}"
}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
